WEBVTT

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.690
The girl was used to being alone.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:20.480
She thought she had borne all
the sadness, all the pain.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.630
But...

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.150
Hinata-chan...

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:47.360
But somehow, when she was in pain, all alone,

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:52.100
it felt as if my heart would
burst out of my chest.

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:36.230
<b>Fourth Hour: Hamaji</b>

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.320
Oh, there's Ma-chan!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:45.040
H-Hey, that guy is flirting with my Ma-chan!

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.930
Now there's another girl.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.350
Ma-chan!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.950
I won't forgive him.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:56.750
I won't forgive that guy!

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:02.760
It smells like salt.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:05.190
We're really here, at the beach.

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:07.040
Hirose-kun!

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.200
Oh, Hamaji-chan.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.150
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.330
Maki-chan, you're here, too.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.690
Ta-dah! I'm in my school swimsuit!

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:15.410
What are you doing, dressed in that?

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:20.350
Whoever has the most fun, wins!

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.940
We're in the middle of nowhere, anyway.

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:24.640
Hamaji!

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.120
Oh, Yui-chan.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:29.470
I can't let you say we're in
the middle of nowhere.

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:32.870
I paid for the inn we're staying at.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.960
That's why we're even on this trip.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.410
Oh, yeah. That's right.

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:39.100
But if you get too upset,

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.270
you'll have gotten that bikini for nothing.

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:42.550
That's true.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.470
I guess when you're trying to show off,

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:47.910
you need a bikini cut to reveal
your best features.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.940
But you have no one to show off to.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:51.980
What was that?

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:53.260
O-Oh, no!

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:56.740
Hey, wait up!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.740
Nope! Nope!

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:01.270
Ah... Now it's no different than
if we were at school.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:04.380
Save me, Hinata-chan!

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.510
Hamaji!

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:08.860
Wait!

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.300
Sorry, I'm late.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:12.620
What?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.230
What's wrong? Did you forget something?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.440
No, not at all.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:20.100
Actually, I was having a hard time finding this.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:22.200
Oh, your camera.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.810
It was mixed up with my clothes.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:26.140
All right! I'll take a picture of you two.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:27.250
Lemme see.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.680
Really?

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.010
Thanks.

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.150
Come on, you two.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:33.290
Get closer together!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.020
Jeez, Maki-san.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.980
Don't tease us.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:38.480
Right, Hirose-sama?

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.780
Y-Yeah.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:46.630
<i>It's almost like...
Like it never happened.</i>

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:49.980
Do you like the ocean here, Hirose-sama?

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:52.100
Yeah...

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.710
Hey, Hinata-chan.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:54.610
About before...

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:57.430
I'll take you to somewhere quieter later.

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.580
I'm gonna take the picture, okay?

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.580
R-Right.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:04.080
I won't let you take a picture without me!

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.680
I wanna take a picture with Hirose-kun!

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:09.850
You're pretty popular, Hirose-kun.

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:11.590
G-Guess so—

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:18.700
Hirose-sama!

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.000
Are you okay, Hirose-sama?

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.930
Wh-What was that?

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:29.960
Don't get so close to Ma-chan, you pervert!

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:30.930
Yuki!

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:31.980
It's you, Yuki!

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.010
What's up?

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.720
I came to drop something off you forgot...
Or something like that.

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:35.720
Who is that?

00:05:35.720 --> 00:05:39.950
What are you talking about?
That's obviously not the case.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.100
Hamaji's sister.

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:39.950
Sister?

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:41.700
I came to get you.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.120
We're going home, Ma-chan.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:44.850
Don't be silly.

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.120
We just got here.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:50.050
Besides, I never even said you
could come on this trip.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:51.330
True.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:54.000
But I'm already here, so let me stay.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:54.820
Don't wanna.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:58.450
Besides, it'll be boring with this loser.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.300
Is she talking about me?

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:03.820
Yukiji-san likes Hamaji-san a lot.

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.680
I'm sure she didn't want to hold
down the fort back home.

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:10.310
Come on, we're leaving.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:13.920
You can go by yourself, Yuki.

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:21.690
I'm not going back without you!

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:24.780
Don't make this difficult, Yuki.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.480
Come on, stand up,

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.100
Yuki.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:33.750
Yui-chan, the bus was supposed
to come soon, right?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.500
Y-Yeah, but...

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.720
Hamaji?

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.190
Let's go home without a fight.

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:41.810
Yuki, take that.

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:44.020
No! No!

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:45.750
I said no!

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.620
All right.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.510
Hamaji-chan,

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.990
since she's here already,
why not let her play with us?

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.500
Is it okay?

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:00.840
It's more fun with more people.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:03.200
We can't let her go home by herself.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:04.950
It's dangerous, too.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:06.270
You guys!

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:08.640
I'm paying for the inn.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:10.130
Be thankful.

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:12.270
That's good, Yuki.

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:13.980
You should say thank you.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.630
Guess I can't help it.

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:17.500
I'll stick around for a day.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.240
Really?

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:18.650
Yeah.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:20.880
Not only were you flirting with Ma-chan,

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.310
but you're a wimp, who tries to get
close to other women, too.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:26.090
I have to stick around to take you down.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:30.030
I think she's gotten something wrong here...

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:41.370
Here I go!

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:42.610
There!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.020
Leave it to me!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.570
Okay!

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:47.550
There!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.410
Here!

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:49.220
Okay!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.210
I've got it!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:54.830
<i>See what happens when you try
to lay your hands on Ma-chan.</i>

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.150
<i>I'll show you.</i>

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:57.590
Here I go!

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:58.820
Here!

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.010
Watch out, Hirose-sama!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.140
Crap! I messed up.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:18.310
W-Was she trying to get me, just now?

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:19.380
I-I don't know.

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:24.480
The sand's warm. It feels good.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.990
<i>I'll help you feel good
for the rest of your life.</i>

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:29.320
<i>Watch this.</i>

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.260
<b>Cement</b>

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:35.160
All right. This time I've got you.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.130
Huh?

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:40.990
Hey! You're the one who took
off with my cement.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.070
Oh, crap...

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:44.030
I'm sorry!

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:45.500
Wait up!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.440
Cement? What was she trying to do with that?

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:50.440
Uh...

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:53.110
A little to the right!

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:55.130
Right there!

00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:00.880
Great work, Hirose-sama.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:02.550
Pretty cool, Hirose-kun.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:05.530
All right! One watermelon, coming up!

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:06.800
Wait, wait.

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:09.060
That one's broken. Use this.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.150
Oh, thanks.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.910
This is kind of heavy.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:14.000
Number two, Maki, going for it!

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.370
<i>It's special, that's why.</i>

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:17.430
<i>I've got you this time.</i>

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.440
Go for it, Maki-chan!

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.960
Maki, you've got it!

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.520
Go! Go!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.740
More to your right! Your right!

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:27.370
Don't lie to her, Yuki.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.180
Maki-san, more to the left!

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:31.780
Yeah, keep going straight.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:33.020
Right there!

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:35.750
Hirose-sama!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.250
It's a real sword!

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:52.540
No!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:55.420
Darn. I failed this time, too.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.790
Hirose-sama, are you okay?
Hirose-sama?

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.380
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:05.950
Why does Ma-chan like that guy?

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.390
Wait...

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:11.390
<i>I can use that. So he's...</i>

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.740
I got sea urchins!

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:18.270
Ma-chan, cool!

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:19.630
Crab over here!

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:22.230
I got some sea snails!

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.240
This is going to be pretty good!

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.990
Oh, Hinata-chan, where's Hirose-kun?

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:32.080
I hadn't seen him, so I thought
you two went somewhere.

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:36.010
I haven't seen him anywhere.

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:40.450
Anywhere? What? What happened?

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:44.390
<i>Huh? Hinata-chan?</i>

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:47.490
<i>Yeah, she wanted to talk to you privately.</i>

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:50.780
<i>She's waiting for you,
but make sure no one sees you.</i>

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:51.930
<i>Over here.</i>

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:55.370
Hinata-chan isn't here yet...

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.360
<i>I wonder if this is okay.</i>

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:03.650
Well, I guess I'll wait for her a bit longer!

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.020
<i>I want you to come, too, Hayami-chan.</i>

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:29.280
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.970
<i>I guess you can't...</i>

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:33.540
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:43.220
Why do I care about Hirose?

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:46.850
He has nothing to do with me.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.440
Hirose-sama!

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:21.990
Hirose-sama, where are you?

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:27.510
God, he's got some nerve,
making me search for him like this.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:31.930
When you find him, just make him
help out with the farming.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:35.620
I wonder where he went, though.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:40.450
I saw him talking to Yukiji-san
before he disappeared.

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:41.590
Really?

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:43.510
What were you talking to
Hirose-kun about, Yuki?

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.880
I wasn't talking to him, really.

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.640
You're lying.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:51.550
When you lie, you can't look people in the eye.

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:54.020
Is that true, Yukiji-san?

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:58.490
Where is Hirose-kun right now?
You know, don't you Yuki?

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:00.260
Please tell us. We won't get mad.

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:03.090
So, please tell us, Yuki.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:04.960
I told you I don't know!

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:06.080
Yuki...

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.390
Ma-chan just needs to stay with me!

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:09.930
You don't need to think about anyone else!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.050
Yuki...

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:12.000
Ma-chan, you jerk!

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:15.000
Wait, Yuki!

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.210
Yukiji-san!

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:25.690
Hinata-chan's taking a while...

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:27.950
Rub, rub.

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.690
You don't have to be so
surprised, Takuma-kun.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:35.640
O-Otoha-chan, why are you here...

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.950
Rub, rub, rub.

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:41.860
S-Stop it, Otoha-chan.

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:45.480
There's steam coming from
your head, Takuma-kun.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:49.340
I guess that was a bit too much stimulation...

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.340
That's a nice wind.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:55.540
Nice and cool?

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:56.530
Yeah.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:13:58.450
What are you fanning me with?

00:13:58.450 --> 00:13:59.960
My skirt.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:00.750
Oh.

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:01.580
Yep.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:02.390
Huh?

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:04.690
It'd be better if I had a fan,

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.220
but there's nothing else to use but my skirt.

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:08.520
Otoha-chan!

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:09.890
That's enough!

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:10.560
Really?

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:12.410
I could do this all day.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.920
That's not the problem here...

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:15.940
Oh.

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:17.840
Actually, Takuma-kun, can you swim?

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:20.380
No, why?

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.980
Hirose-kun!

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.910
Where are you?

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:35.310
How'd you fare?

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.450
Didn't see him.

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:41.730
Hamaji-san, is there a reason Yukiji-san

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.390
always wants to be with you?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.370
I'm sorry!

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:51.600
My mother...

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:54.370
The reason lies with our mother.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:58.220
She died when Yuki was still young.

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:01.610
It was a pretty big shock to Yuki back then.

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:06.240
And so, I think she's worried that
I might also disappear,

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:09.460
one day, now that I'm filling in for Mom.

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.250
That's why...

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:14.400
So that's why she acts that way
about people you're close to.

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:14.960
Yeah.

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:18.020
It doesn't look like it, but she's actually
worried about her older sister.

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:25.320
This is Yuki's...

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.480
<i>She doesn't know how I feel about her.</i>

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.790
Ma-chan, you dummy.

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:46.120
This rock was almost as tall as I am...

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:52.580
<i>She said all that,
but Otoha-chan swam away and left.</i>

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.010
Ouch...

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.950
<i>This is bad. My leg cramped up.</i>

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.120
Save me!

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.820
Someone save me!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.250
Save me!

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:18.190
Someone...

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.180
Yukiji-chan.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:22.120
Wait! She's drowning!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.690
Yukiji-chan!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:26.630
Someone...

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.570
Yukiji-chan... I have to save her.

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:32.830
B-But...

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:36.310
Save me!

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:40.680
Yukiji-chan!

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:58.300
Damn it...

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:31.110
Hirose-kun!

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.020
Hirose-kun!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:35.700
Hirose-kun!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:39.440
Hirose-sama!

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:41.910
Hirose-sama!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:46.900
Hirose-sama!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.600
I was...

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:52.880
Where's Yukiji-chan?

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.920
She's fine. Thanks.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.860
Thank goodness...

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.120
She's fine.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.680
I'm glad both of you are okay!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.070
Really!

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:05.080
Don't do anything like this again, Yuki.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:08.570
Now say thank you to the guy who saved you.

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:14.500
Come on, Yuki.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.810
She's getting embarrassed.

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:20.480
Hirose-kun, I'm really grateful
that you saved Yuki.

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:23.500
No... I mean, I ended up drowning, too.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.720
How did I...

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:28.060
Yeah, that's it!

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:31.220
How did Hamaji's lips feel?

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.160
Huh? Lips?

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.430
I gave you CPR!

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:38.000
<i>Hirose-sama!</i>

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:38.650
<i>Hirose!</i>

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:39.460
<i>Hirose-kun!</i>

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.270
<i>Open your eyes, Hirose!</i>

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:42.600
<i>Hirose-sama!</i>

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:44.370
<i>Get out of the way!</i>

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:45.830
<i>Hirose-kun!</i>

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:46.600
<i>Hamaji-san!</i>

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:50.270
<i>Ma-chan!</i>

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.680
<i>CPR!</i>

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:53.610
<i>This is my first time ever seeing it!</i>

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:15.620
I'm grateful to you for showing me
such a scene, Hirose.

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:17.370
Right?

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:20.800
U-Um...

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.140
Yes?

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.340
Thank you!

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:28.610
Yukiji-chan!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.820
This is a nice bath...

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:06.040
Hinata-chan, you've got some
pretty large ones there.

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:07.650
I-I...

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:08.750
Can I touch them?

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.900
What are you doing, Maki-san?

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:14.770
What's wrong? What's wrong?

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:15.830
Stop!

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:18.370
<i>I said what I said,</i>

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:21.460
<i>but it's not like I'm okay with your
getting close to Ma-chan.</i>

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:23.730
<i>Take this!</i>

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.660
What do you have against me?

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:34.650
You've been humiliating me
since this afternoon!

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:35.890
I'm sorry!

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:36.880
Pretty lively over there.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:43.020
<i>But even so, I'm pretty exhausted.</i>

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.970
Nice bath.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:46.910
Yeah.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.470
Hamaji-chan!

00:20:52.340 --> 00:20:55.600
I'll wash your back, to thank you for today,

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:57.980
Takuma-kun.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:02.080
I'm glad you feel that way, but... Uh...

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:05.480
Huh?

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:11.410
What's wrong?

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:17.100
Pretty nice bath.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:30.920
<i>I guess I never got to talk to
Hinata-chan about anything.</i>

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:50.840
Hayami-chan?

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.280
Hirose...

00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:55.140
Hayami-chan, you came!

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:56.830
Wait!

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:05.970
I came to ask how you feel.

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:09.410
How I feel?

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:16.710
Hirose-sama?

00:24:00.030 --> 00:24:14.800
<b>My
Bride</b>

00:24:00.620 --> 00:24:05.010
This whole time, Hirose-kun
thought I was a girl!

00:24:05.010 --> 00:24:08.370
There's no way someone as
cute as you could be a girl.

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:09.520
Just think about it logically.

00:24:09.520 --> 00:24:11.570
Yuki, you're too kind!

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:14.800
<b>Fifth Hour: Kagura</b>
